{"id":"6588280b3415f303","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-plain-no-bounded-deficiency.md","title":"No Infinite Sequence Has Bounded Plain Deficiency","display":"thm-plain-no-bounded-deficiency — No Infinite Sequence Has Bounded Plain Deficiency","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-plain-no-bounded-deficiency","aliases":["43-thm-plain-no-bounded-deficiency"],"display":"thm-plain-no-bounded-deficiency — No Infinite Sequence Has Bounded Plain Deficiency","depends_on":["[[43-df-kolm]]","[[43-df-infseq]]","[[43-thm-plain-prefix-dips]]"],"source_book":"Rodney G. Downey and Denis R. Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","source_version":"Draft, 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages","source_location":"Lemma 6.1.5 and §9.2.1","source_printed_pages":"89; 169","source_pdf_pages":"109; 189","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_statement_checked":true,"source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-plain-no-bounded-deficiency"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-plain-no-bounded-deficiency</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-plain-no-bounded-deficiency — No Infinite Sequence Has Bounded Plain Deficiency"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a0589ee7a1cc12e8\" href=\"?note=a0589ee7a1cc12e8\" title=\"43-df-kolm\">43-df-kolm</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"565c3258eee2a5ff\" href=\"?note=565c3258eee2a5ff\" title=\"43-df-infseq\">43-df-infseq</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"99a0eabcf30b9356\" href=\"?note=99a0eabcf30b9356\" title=\"43-thm-plain-prefix-dips\">43-thm-plain-prefix-dips</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book","html":"Rodney G. Downey and Denis R. Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"source_version","html":"Draft, 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Lemma 6.1.5 and §9.2.1"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"89; 169"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"109; 189"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in2^\\omega\">\\(X\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a0589ee7a1cc12e8\" href=\"?note=a0589ee7a1cc12e8\" title=\"43-df-kolm\">43-df-kolm</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall X\\in2^\\omega\\;\\forall c\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\;C(X\\upharpoonright n)&lt;n-c.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall X\\in2^\\omega\\;\\forall c\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\;C(X\\upharpoonright n)&lt;n-c.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>将有限串前缀下降用于任意足够长的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 的前段。因每个固定前段只有有限亏损，亏损无界还蕴含存在无限多个下降位置。</p>\n<p>来源：所给 2007-07-28 草稿，Lemma 6.1.5 and §9.2.1；印刷页 89; 169，PDF 页 109; 189。本次逐项核对陈述；下文给出笔记内论证，未作机器形式验证。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-kolm","status":"resolved","id":"a0589ee7a1cc12e8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-kolm]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-infseq","status":"resolved","id":"565c3258eee2a5ff","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-infseq]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-thm-plain-prefix-dips","status":"resolved","id":"99a0eabcf30b9356","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-thm-plain-prefix-dips]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-kolm","status":"resolved","id":"a0589ee7a1cc12e8","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$X\\in2^\\omega$；$C$ 见 [[43-df-kolm]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"X\\in2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall X\\in2^\\omega\\;\\forall c\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\;C(X\\upharpoonright n)<n-c.","display":true},{"tex":"X","display":false}],"bytes":1330,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-132","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-plain-no-bounded-deficiency]] — No Infinite Sequence Has Bounded Plain Deficiency"}],"outgoing":["a0589ee7a1cc12e8","565c3258eee2a5ff","99a0eabcf30b9356"]}